{"id":"p9z9twu8fcf3ef6y5pc0l62ap","title":"名古屋大学研究：蛋白质尾部如何塑造疟蚊细胞间通道的对称性","originalTitle":"Protein tails help shape mosquito cell-to-cell channels","summary":"名古屋大学研究团队在《国家科学院院刊》发表论文，首次解析疟蚊innexin通道的七聚体结构，发现N末端形成内环是通道对称化的关键步骤。通过缩短N末端氨基酸序列（从第2位开始逐个删除），证实该结构对电流传导至关重要：删除2个氨基酸导致通道完全失活，且内环缺失后通道呈不规则形态。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-protein-tails-mosquito-cell-channels.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T20:40:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T20:45:25.102Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T20:45:25.102Z","category":"life-science","tags":["研究成果","蛋白质结构"],"score":74,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"becf86a8-9da2-4222-9288-ee75e681ebec","title":"名古屋大学解析疟蚊细胞通道对称性关键机制"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"becf86a8-9da2-4222-9288-ee75e681ebec","title":"名古屋大学解析疟蚊细胞通道对称性关键机制"}],"topics":[{"slug":"protein-structure","name":"蛋白质结构与设计"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f5MwYFq_QkNM","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}